#. module: l10n_cz_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_contract__l10n_cz_is_state_insured
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_employee__l10n_cz_is_state_insured
msgid ""
"Pensioner / student / parental leave / jobseeker / disabled: the health-"
"insurance minimum-base top-up does not apply."
msgstr ""
"Dôchodca / študent / rodičovská dovolenka / uchádzač o zamestnanie / osoba "
"so zdravotným postihnutím: doplatok do minimálneho vymeriavacieho základu "
"zdravotného poistenia sa neuplatňuje."

#. module: l10n_cz_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_contract__l10n_cz_meal_allowance
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_employee__l10n_cz_meal_allowance
msgid ""
"Per-shift meal allowance. Tax-exempt up to the statutory limit; the excess "
"(taxable) is P2."
msgstr ""
"Príspevok na stravu za zmenu. Oslobodený od dane do zákonného limitu; "
"prekročenie (zdaniteľné) je P2."

#. module: l10n_cz_hr_payroll_base
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_cz_hr_payroll_base.res_config_settings_view_form_l10n_cz_payroll
